    "description": "<p>Each time you acquire this Skill, you discover <strong>a new type of magiseed</strong>.</p><p>During a conflict, if there are <strong>no magiseeds</strong> in your <strong>garden</strong>, you may use an action and spend 20 Mind Points to <strong>plant a magiseed</strong> of a type you have discovered.</p><hr><p>For <strong>magiseed</strong> breakdown and a list of <strong>Magiseeds</strong>, refer to: @UUID[Compendium.projectfu.handouts.JournalEntry.16lV3Tse5aK9qipX]{Floralist Rules} or see <strong>Natural Fantasy Atlas</strong>, page <strong>139</strong>.<br>To <strong>automate</strong>, VTT Instructions can be found here: @UUID[Compendium.projectfu.handouts.JournalEntry.16lV3Tse5aK9qipX.JournalEntryPage.8e8kglGnqyKy1Nju]{Magiseed VTT Instructions}</p>",
